## Lore

The Protector is the human face of NTSET, the ISS police division that hunts
the supernatural inside the Coalition cities. Protectors lead squads of Dog
Boys and Psi-Stalkers through the sewers, slums and lower levels, raiding
monster nests, rescuing victims and backing the ISS on homicides, kidnappings
and raids involving superhumans, nonhumans or magic.

Citizens respect them and fear them in equal measure. Veterans are so used to
the fantastic that little rattles them, and most wear the nickname Nut Set as
a badge of honour.

## GM Notes

NTSET operatives never leave their city; their jurisdiction is the Coalition''s
cities and towns and nothing beyond. The standard kit is built for monster
hunting - silver, wooden stakes and a mallet beside the energy weapons. Lt.
Jack Crazy Cavanaugh (printed 189-190) is the division''s most decorated
example and a ready-made NPC handler for a Dog Boy squad.
